<title>USA: JSB Financial applies for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>JSB Financial applies for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>LYNBROOK, N.Y. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>JSB Financial Inc, the holding company for Jamaica Savings Bank FSB, said Wednesday it has applied for listing on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Pending approval by the NYSE, the company expects to begin trading on the NYSE by early August under the symbol &quot;JSB&quot;.</p>
<p>JSB Financial Inc had assets of $1.53 billion as of March 31, and operated 13 offices in New York City and Long Island.</p>
